      "statement": "The default task strategy converts protocol 1 and hybrid messages to protocol 2 form, builds a Request, discards revoked or expired requests on receipt, sends task_received and task-received, and then schedules ETA tasks on the timer, routes rate-limited tasks to token buckets, or reserves and hands the request to the worker.",
